---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<!-- Site B · resume — a complete CV page, print-friendly -->
<BaseLayout
	title="Resume — Tarik Duyar"
	description="Resume of Ahmet Tarik Duyar — full-stack software engineer. Streaming platforms, .NET systems, Rust."
	bodyClass="bg-[#0a0b0d] text-gray-200 antialiased"
>
	<div class="bg-[#0d0e12] border-x border-[#90c5ff14] max-w-5xl mx-auto min-h-dvh">
		<nav class="py-5 px-6 md:px-12 border-b border-[#90c5ff14] sticky top-0 bg-[#0d0e12]/90 backdrop-blur-sm z-40 print:hidden">
			<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
				<a href="/12" class="flex items-center gap-3">
					<span class="font-oldturcic text-blue-400/70 text-lg leading-none select-none" aria-hidden="true">𐱅</span>
					<span class="font-sinistre text-xl text-white">Tarik Duyar</span>
				</a>
				<ul class="flex gap-5 md:gap-7 text-sm">
					<li><a href="/12/writing" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">Writing</a></li>
					<li><a href="/12/resume" class="text-white underline decoration-blue-400/50 underline-offset-4">Resume</a></li>
					<li><a href="/12/glyphs" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">Glyphs</a></li>
					<li><a href="mailto:atduyar@gmail.com" class="text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/30 px-3 py-1 hover:bg-blue-600/10 hover:border-blue-400/50 transition-all">Contact</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main class="px-6 md:px-12 py-14 max-w-3xl">
			<!-- Header -->
			<header class="mb-12">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
					<div>
						<h1 class="font-sinistre text-4xl text-white mb-2">Ahmet Tarik Duyar</h1>
						<p class="text-blue-300">Full-Stack Software Engineer</p>
						<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Sarajevo, Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina · atduyar@gmail.com · github.com/atduyar</p>
					</div>
					<button id="print-btn" type="button" class="print:hidden text-sm px-4 py-2 border border-blue-400/30 text-blue-300 hover:bg-blue-600/10 hover:border-blue-400/50 transition-all cursor-pointer">
						Print / Save PDF
					</button>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mt-6 max-w-2xl">
					Engineer with end-to-end ownership of production systems: three years
					building and operating a streaming platform with 17,000+ paying
					subscribers — architecture, database, payments, and deployment.
					Comfortable from React down to Rust.
				</p>
			</header>

			<!-- Experience -->
			<section class="mb-12">
				<h2 class="font-sinistre text-2xl text-white mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
					Experience
					<span class="flex-1 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-[#90c5ff14] to-transparent"></span>
				</h2>

				<article class="mb-10">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
						<h3 class="text-lg text-white">Full-Stack Engineer · Deniz Egece Co. Ltd.</h3>
						<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 tabular-nums">2022 — Present</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside marker:text-blue-400/40">
						<li>Founding engineer on <span class="text-gray-200">EgeceTV</span>, a health &amp; education streaming platform: 17,000+ paid subscribers, ~1,000 videos, clients on web, iOS, Android, Android TV, and Apple TV.</li>
						<li>Designed the backend architecture and MySQL schema; a single GraphQL API serves all five client platforms.</li>
						<li>Built the subscription payment system end to end.</li>
						<li>Set up CI/CD with GitHub Actions; releases ship without manual steps.</li>
						<li>Co-built a distance-education platform (WebRTC video consultations, scheduling, homework tracking) using .NET and Clean Architecture, in a five-person team handling sensitive health data.</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-3">Next.js · GraphQL · C#/.NET · MySQL · PostgreSQL · Prisma · Docker · AWS</p>
				</article>

				<article>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
						<h3 class="text-lg text-white">Freelance Developer</h3>
						<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 tabular-nums">2021 — 2022</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside marker:text-blue-400/40">
						<li>Built and still operate <span class="text-gray-200">Evrenomi</span>, a C#/.NET blogging platform: 95+ Lighthouse score, self-managed Linux hosting.</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-3">C# · REST · Linux</p>
				</article>
			</section>

			<!-- Projects -->
			<section class="mb-12">
				<h2 class="font-sinistre text-2xl text-white mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
					Open Source &amp; Side Projects
					<span class="flex-1 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-[#90c5ff14] to-transparent"></span>
				</h2>
				<div class="space-y-6 text-sm">
					<div>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3 mb-1">
							<h3 class="text-white">REKV</h3>
							<span class="text-gray-600">Rust</span>
							<a href="https://github.com/atduyar/rekv" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors print:hidden">github.com/atduyar/rekv</a>
						</div>
						<p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Type-safe key-value store library: memory-mapped storage, zero-copy deserialization, async I/O.</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3 mb-1">
							<h3 class="text-white">Make2Game</h3>
							<span class="text-gray-600">C++ / OpenGL / Lua</span>
							<a href="https://github.com/atduyar/make2game" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors print:hidden">github.com/atduyar/make2game</a>
						</div>
						<p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">2D game engine built from scratch, with Lua scripting and an immediate-mode (ImGui) editor.</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3 mb-1">
							<h3 class="text-white">Self-hosted infrastructure</h3>
							<span class="text-gray-600">Linux / Debian</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Personally administer the VPS infrastructure running this site, a federated Matrix homeserver, and all side projects.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Skills -->
			<section class="mb-12">
				<h2 class="font-sinistre text-2xl text-white mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
					Skills
					<span class="flex-1 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-[#90c5ff14] to-transparent"></span>
				</h2>
				<dl class="space-y-3 text-sm">
					<div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4">
						<dt class="text-gray-600">Web</dt>
						<dd class="text-gray-300">TypeScript, React, Next.js, GraphQL, Astro</dd>
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4">
						<dt class="text-gray-600">Backend</dt>
						<dd class="text-gray-300">C# / .NET, REST, Clean Architecture, WebRTC</dd>
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4">
						<dt class="text-gray-600">Data</dt>
						<dd class="text-gray-300">MySQL, PostgreSQL, Prisma, Entity Framework</dd>
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4">
						<dt class="text-gray-600">Systems</dt>
						<dd class="text-gray-300">Rust, C, C++, Linux administration</dd>
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4">
						<dt class="text-gray-600">Infra</dt>
						<dd class="text-gray-300">Docker, AWS, GitHub Actions, Cloudflare</dd>
					</div>
				</dl>
			</section>

			<!-- Education -->
			<section class="mb-12">
				<h2 class="font-sinistre text-2xl text-white mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
					Education
					<span class="flex-1 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-[#90c5ff14] to-transparent"></span>
				</h2>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-white">B.Sc. Computer Science — International University of Sarajevo</h3>
						<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Honor student</p>
					</div>
					<span class="text-sm text-gray-500">in progress</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Languages (placeholder) -->
			<section class="mb-12">
				<h2 class="font-sinistre text-2xl text-white mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
					Languages
					<span class="flex-1 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-[#90c5ff14] to-transparent"></span>
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-400">
					Turkish (native) · English (professional) · Bosnian (conversational)
					<span class="text-gray-600 text-xs ml-2">— placeholder, adjust levels</span>
				</p>
			</section>

			<footer class="pt-8 border-t border-[#90c5ff14] text-xs text-gray-600 print:hidden">
				References and detailed project walk-throughs available on request ·
				<a href="mailto:atduyar@gmail.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">atduyar@gmail.com</a>
			</footer>
		</main>
	</div>

	<script is:inline>
		document.getElementById("print-btn").addEventListener("click", () => window.print());
	</script>

	<style>
		@media print {
			body { background: white !important; color: #111 !important; }
		}
	</style>
</BaseLayout>
